mbedFrom=oembed&lang=zh-CN","observedAt":"2026-09-17T11:37:40.763Z"},"following":{"value":62,"raw":"62","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/embed/@cbsnewyork?embedFrom=oembed&lang=zh-CN","observedAt":"2026-09-17T11:37:40.763Z"},"totalLikes":{"value":50300000,"raw":"50300000","precision":"exact","sourceUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/embed/@cbsnewyork?embedFrom=oembed&lang=zh-CN","observedAt":"2026-09-17T11:37:40.763Z"},"source":{"kind":"creator_embed","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/embed/@cbsnewyork?embedFrom=oembed&lang=zh-CN","observedAt":"2026-09-17T11:37:40.763Z","contentHash":"275272794a85b7499d5a36ec0b9cbfef332dee01918e0729e70712854d6c3897"},"videoSnapshot":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.tiktok.com/embed/@cbsnewyork?embedFrom=oembed&lang=zh-CN","observedAt":"2026-09-17T11:37:40.763Z","discoveryBasis":"creator_embed","latestVerified":false,"videos":[{"id":"7679821934049152286","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7679821934049152286","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"Think you look like Mayor Mamdani? A look-alike contest is happening today at Washington Square Park, with a $100 grand prize up for grabs! ","views":3000000},{"id":"7675452619728456991","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7675452619728456991","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"A tiny, 8-week-old kitten was rescued from the median barrier of the Sunrise Highway this morning in Central Islip. Drivers reported seeing the kitten as they drove past. Cat rescuer John DeBacker said Suffolk County Police were able to briefly shut down the highway while he grabbed the animal. He says the kitten is a female and is getting medically evaluated before she will be put up for adoption.","views":8100000},{"id":"7686287471046397215","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7686287471046397215","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"A warning to travelers trying to bring popular squishy toys through security checkpoints. ","views":1266},{"id":"7686208273422273822","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7686208273422273822","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"Seventeen new public bathrooms are being installed across New York City, Mayor Zohran Mamdani announced Wednesday. Throne Labs has been chosen to fulfill the $4 million, yearlong modular public bathroom pilot program. The free, ADA-accessible bathrooms will be open from 7 a.m. to 10 p.m. In addition to a sink and a toilet, each bathroom is climate controlled and has a baby changing station. Installation begins this week.","views":3053},{"id":"7686197786341133598","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7686197786341133598","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"BREAKING: Three people were stabbed Wednesday afternoon at Westchester Community College in Valhalla, New York, according to county officials. All three victims were taken to a nearby hospital. Police say two suspects are in custody and a knife was recovered. Officials say there is no ongoing threat to campus. #newyork #westchester ","views":117200},{"id":"7686193286872124702","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7686193286872124702","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"Palestinian activist Mahmoud Khalil has sued Columbia University, alleging the school failed to address harassment against him and other members of a pro-Palestinian campus group and retaliated when they reported concerns. The university declined to comment on the lawsuit but said it is committed to protecting its community from discrimination and harassment. Read more at the link. #newyork #columbia  ","views":842},{"id":"7686165790738910494","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7686165790738910494","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"New York lawmakers announced a new bill Wednesday that would ban the sale of high-speed e-bikes. State Sen. Kristen Gonzalez and Assemblymember Diana Moreno are targeting what are often called \"e-motos.\" These devices are being sold as e-bikes and e-scooters but can go much faster than what's legal on city streets. The bill would prohibit retailers from selling certain devices capable of going more than 20 mph. Sellers could face civil penalties of up to $1,000 for prohibited sales, according to the legislation. Read more at the link in bio. ","views":8695},{"id":"7685958364739800350","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7685958364739800350","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"A 3-month old kitten that was picked up outside a Brooklyn shop, is now back at his Park Slope bodega.","views":4880},{"id":"7685956415680400670","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7685956415680400670","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"Crews continue to clean up thousands of gallons of diesel fuel that was spilled from an AI data center in Secaucus late last week. The diesel fuel discharged from a storage tank at Equinix Data Center on Friday.","views":3686},{"id":"7685902936404167966","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7685902936404167966","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"It is no secret that AI is changing the way people do business. It's also affecting the job search, so what does the future hold? See Dick Brennan's full report at our link in bio.","views":875},{"id":"7685827745523305758","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7685827745523305758","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"Health officials are urging people in the tri-state area to get vaccinated amid a rise in COVID cases. Last month, the FDA approved updated COVID vaccines to protect against the new strain. ","views":32400},{"id":"7685790936818928926","url":"https://www.tiktok.com/@cbsnewyork/video/7685790936818928926","authorHandle":"cbsnewyork","description":"An estimated 5,000 gallons of diesel fuel spilled from a storage tank at an Equinix Data Center in Secaucus, New Jersey, according to the New Jersey Department of Environmental Protection. Officials said the spill has been contained, while cleanup crews continue removing fuel from nearby Anderson Creek. Read more at the link. #newjersey #secaucus #datacenter ","views":47000}],"warnings":["TikTok 创作者嵌入页的视频样本没有已核实的发布时间或最新顺序；本轮仅读取播放量，单条点赞和评论数未采集。"]},"biography":"🗽News for New Yorkers + the Tri-State"}],"emails":[],"websites":[{"url":"https://cbsnews.com/newyork","label":"CBS New York","identityStatus":"channel_published"}],"profileSources":{"name":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"url":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"handle":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"description":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"thumbnailUrl":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"subscriberText":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"videoCountText":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"countrySelfReported":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"link:https://cbsnews.com/newyork":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"link:https://www.facebook.com/cbsnewyork":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"link:https://x.com/cbsnewyork":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedAt":"2026-09-16T04:19:33.207Z"},"link:https://www.instagram.com/cbsnewyork":{"sourceUrl":"https://www.youtube.com/channel/UCNZyLULUQBp5e9Q1cKtvk6Q","observedA